{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52007","headline":"游山赠仲长先生子光 · 王绩","name":"游山赠仲长先生子光","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"试出南河曲，还起北山期。\n连峰无蹔断，绝岭互相疑。\n结[藤]（滕）标往路，刻树记来时。\n沙场聊憩路，石壁旋题诗。\n叶秋红稍下，苔寒绿更滋。\n幽寻多乐处，勿怪往还迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52007.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52007","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}